# The heater metal hardly matters: its own resistance to heat flow is negligible next to the oxide.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy.
title Aluminium heater
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=60 ymin=-10 ymax=5
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 5
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect al -1 1 4 4.25
heater h xmin=-1 xmax=1 ymin=4 ymax=4.25 power=0.1
probe wg xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg h 171.47609 1e-7
expect pi_power wg h 24.2988201 1e-7
expect peak 40.7864242 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 14400
